    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Demonslayer AKA Me</i>\u00a0offers a fresh take on the cultivation journey, seamlessly blending the sprawling adventures of a mystical immortal world with the fast-paced action of a classic scrolling shooter. Engage in thrilling aerial combat as you command your squads, switching members in real-time to adapt to every challenge that lies ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World of Cultivation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a richly woven cultivation realm, featuring twelve illustrious sects, three grand capitals, twenty-five vibrant towns, and ten mysterious islands. Every location is brimming with untold stories\u00a0and formidable challenges, awaiting those who dare to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/eb2ab2cd82e44d788edb014e5c4c617c.poster.avif?t=1747304928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/eb2ab2cd82e44d788edb014e5c4c617c.webm?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/eb2ab2cd82e44d788edb014e5c4c617c.mp4?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a cultivator like no other with 32 distinct Spirit Bodies, 10 foundational Spirit Roots, and countless combinations of innate traits and heavenly Destinies. Master the ten elemental arts\u2014Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, Earth, Lightning, Wind, Ice, Light, and Shadow\u2014as you explore over 500 Heart Sutras\u00a0and Mystical\u00a0Techniques. Arm yourself with more than 300 legendary Artifacts and Treasures, steadily ascending toward the heights of immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/694758bcbae97fd346dedaa24284f487.poster.avif?t=1747304928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/694758bcbae97fd346dedaa24284f487.webm?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/694758bcbae97fd346dedaa24284f487.mp4?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Aerial Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the thrill of classic side-scrolling and vertical shooter battles. Whether defending your abode\u00a0against intruders or engaging in high-stakes duels, each mode challenges your skill, strategy, and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/ebc0bc04dcc4036756608a10b4733906.poster.avif?t=1747304928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/ebc0bc04dcc4036756608a10b4733906.webm?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/ebc0bc04dcc4036756608a10b4733906.mp4?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cultivator's Way of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of boundless cultivation possibilities. Refine elixirs, forge treasures, weave arrange formations, and inscribe powerful talismans.\u00a0Tend spiritual fields, gather rare resources, and trade your spoils at auctions, in black\u00a0markets, or in games of chance. Design your personal Immortal Abode, complete with spirit springs, celestial fields, meditation chambers, and alchemy halls\u2014a sanctuary\u00a0to further your path toward enlightenment.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Demonslayer AKA Me</i>\u00a0offers a fresh take on the cultivation journey, seamlessly blending the sprawling adventures of a mystical immortal world with the fast-paced action of a classic scrolling shooter. Engage in thrilling aerial combat as you command your squads, switching members in real-time to adapt to every challenge that lies ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World of Cultivation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a richly woven cultivation realm, featuring twelve illustrious sects, three grand capitals, twenty-five vibrant towns, and ten mysterious islands. Every location is brimming with untold stories\u00a0and formidable challenges, awaiting those who dare to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/eb2ab2cd82e44d788edb014e5c4c617c.poster.avif?t=1747304928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/eb2ab2cd82e44d788edb014e5c4c617c.webm?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/eb2ab2cd82e44d788edb014e5c4c617c.mp4?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a cultivator like no other with 32 distinct Spirit Bodies, 10 foundational Spirit Roots, and countless combinations of innate traits and heavenly Destinies. Master the ten elemental arts\u2014Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, Earth, Lightning, Wind, Ice, Light, and Shadow\u2014as you explore over 500 Heart Sutras\u00a0and Mystical\u00a0Techniques. Arm yourself with more than 300 legendary Artifacts and Treasures, steadily ascending toward the heights of immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/694758bcbae97fd346dedaa24284f487.poster.avif?t=1747304928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/694758bcbae97fd346dedaa24284f487.webm?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/694758bcbae97fd346dedaa24284f487.mp4?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Aerial Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the thrill of classic side-scrolling and vertical shooter battles. Whether defending your abode\u00a0against intruders or engaging in high-stakes duels, each mode challenges your skill, strategy, and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/ebc0bc04dcc4036756608a10b4733906.poster.avif?t=1747304928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/ebc0bc04dcc4036756608a10b4733906.webm?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313440/extras/ebc0bc04dcc4036756608a10b4733906.mp4?t=1747304928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cultivator's Way of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of boundless cultivation possibilities. Refine elixirs, forge treasures, weave arrange formations, and inscribe powerful talismans.\u00a0Tend spiritual fields, gather rare resources, and trade your spoils at auctions, in black\u00a0markets, or in games of chance. Design your personal Immortal Abode, complete with spirit springs, celestial fields, meditation chambers, and alchemy halls\u2014a sanctuary\u00a0to further your path toward enlightenment.</p>",
